  "description": "",
  "code": "/* Example: Counting letters A, B, C in the stream of text */\n\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid main() {\n\n    int ch;\n    int a = 0, b = 0, c = 0;\n\n    /* Accumulating counters in the loop */\n    while ((ch = getchar()) != EOF)\n        if (ch == 'a' || ch == 'A')\n            a++;\n        else if (ch == 'b' || ch == 'B')\n            b++;\n        else if (ch == 'c' || ch == 'C')\n            c++;\n\n    /* Printing results */\n    printf(\"\\nNumbers of characters:\\n\\n\");\n    printf(\"a %d; b %d; c %d; \\n\", a, b, c);\n}",
